    "en": {
      "trackName": "Brick Buster for Watch",
      "description": "Get ready for a blast from the past, reimagined for your wrist! Brick Buster for Watch brings the timeless arcade excitement of brick-breaking games directly to your Apple Watch. Tap, swipe, and use the Digital Crown to control your paddle, smash through colorful bricks, and clear levels in this addictive and fast-paced game.\n\nExperience classic gameplay anytime, anywhere. Whether you have a few minutes to spare or want to dive into a longer session, Brick Buster for Watch is the perfect companion. Enjoy quick rounds on your commute, during a break, or whenever you need a fun mental escape.\n\nKey Features:\n• Addictive brick-breaking gameplay optimized for Apple Watch\n• Intuitive controls: tap, swipe, and Digital Crown support\n• Dozens of challenging levels to conquer\n• Track your high scores and aim for perfection\n• Quick play sessions perfect for on-the-go entertainment\n• Vibrant graphics and engaging sound effects\n\nDownload Brick Buster for Watch today and start smashing your way to victory!",
      "releaseNotes": "",
